  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We have finished question 15, spiral matrix.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3860,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 116,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "So our global progress is now 15 out of 227, and we are still inside arrays and hashing.",
      "start_ms": 4460,
      "end_ms": 12540,
      "start_frame": 134,
      "end_frame": 376,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, question 16, subarray sum equals k.",
      "start_ms": 13520,
      "end_ms": 17440,
      "start_frame": 406,
      "end_frame": 523,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, this problem looks very simple.",
      "start_ms": 18260,
      "end_ms": 20840,
      "start_frame": 548,
      "end_frame": 625,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "We have an array, we have a target, k, e, and we need to count how many contiguous subarrays have sum exactly equal to k.",
      "start_ms": 21220,
      "end_ms": 31800,
      "start_frame": 637,
      "end_frame": 954,
      "word_count": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "But there are a few small details here that completely change how we solve it.",
      "start_ms": 32620,
      "end_ms": 37480,
      "start_frame": 979,
      "end_frame": 1124,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "So before thinking about optimization, let us understand the question properly.",
      "start_ms": 37880,
      "end_ms": 43860,
      "start_frame": 1136,
      "end_frame": 1316,
      "word_count": 11
    }
  ],
